Third-party data

The MIT License above covers only the source code in this repository. It does
not cover the image data in `samples_bsd500.pth`, which consists of image
patches taken from the Berkeley Segmentation Dataset (BSDS500):

    https://www2.eecs.berkeley.edu/Research/Projects/CS/vision/grouping/resources.html

The copyright in these images remains with their respective owners, and the
data is provided solely under the terms of use of the original dataset. In
particular, the BSDS500 images are distributed for research purposes only. Any
use of the image data beyond those terms is not permitted by this license. The
image prior distributed with this repository was learned from BSDS500 patches;
its use is likewise subject to the same terms.
